OPERATIONAL PREMISES

The following optimization model operates using entirely arbitrary ETFs, with sectors selected at random. 
Consequently, these should NOT be taken as investment advice; they reflect only a portion of the project's potential returns. 
Through a careful selection of ETFs and their respective sectors, it is possible to manage and balance each user's return profile. 
Indeed, every user can modify the configuration section to include the specific financial instruments and sectors that best align with their individual investment needs.
